 class="promo-carousel__indicator" aria-label="Slide 2 of 3" data-gtm-track="btn-carousel-slider indicator dot-position 2-send" data-v-4d607c02><span class="promo-carousel__indicator-dot" data-v-4d607c02></span></button><button class="promo-carousel__indicator" aria-label="Slide 3 of 3" data-gtm-track="btn-carousel-slider indicator dot-position 3-send" data-v-4d607c02><span class="promo-carousel__indicator-dot" data-v-4d607c02></span></button><!--]--></div><span id="skip-promo-carousel" data-v-4d607c02></span></section><section id="why-send-a-parcel-with-evri?" class="section-wrapper article-link-module article-link-module--neutral conditional-section-wrapper" data-slice-type="article_link_module" data-slice-variation="3ColumnWithoutLinks" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!--[--><h2><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Why send a parcel with Evri?<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h2><!--]--><div class="article-link-module__section-description" data-v-10a41d36><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->With Evri, you can quickly send a parcel cheaply across the whole of the UK and beyond. UK prices start at £2.62! Even when choosing our standard delivery service, you’ll get immediate access to the following parcel service benefits:<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><div class="article-link-module__cards-container" data-v-10a41d36><!--[--><article class="article-link-item article-link-item--neutral" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-6b4a6e25><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJWZbqstJ9-Tf__EVRI_LOCATION_03_31119ddd.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJWZbqstJ9-Tf__EVRI_LOCATION_03_3111.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=470%2C0%2C5460%2C3642&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJWZbqstJ9-Tf__EVRI_LOCATION_03_3111.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=470%2C0%2C5460%2C3642&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJWZbqstJ9-Tf__EVRI_LOCATION_03_3111.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=470%2C0%2C5460%2C3642&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="An Evri ParcelShop is in full view with its blue signage and a customer is walking up the accesssbility ramp and holding a parcel." width="1000" height="667" class="article-link-item__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__content" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__text-block" data-v-6b4a6e25><!----><!--[--><h3><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Complete delivery flexibility<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h3><!--]--><div class="article-link-item__description" data-v-6b4a6e25><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Post a package using any one of our 10,000+ ParcelShops and Lockers across the UK or book a delivery straight from your door with our Courier Collection service, matter where you are in the country.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><!----></div></article><article class="article-link-item article-link-item--neutral" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-6b4a6e25><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6zdBZbqstJ9-inZ_EVRI_LOCATION_05_78198a65.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6zdBZbqstJ9-inZ_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7819.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6zdBZbqstJ9-inZ_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7819.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6zdBZbqstJ9-inZ_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7819.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="A woman is sat at home at her desk smiling looking at her laptop screen" width="1000" height="667" class="article-link-item__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__content" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__text-block" data-v-6b4a6e25><!----><!--[--><h3><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->A quality delivery service<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h3><!--]--><div class="article-link-item__description" data-v-6b4a6e25><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->With our standard parcel service, you get full tracking on every delivery, photo confirmation of your parcel’s arrival, and free cover up to a value of £20 as standard. We’ll even provide you with a 1-hour window for both collection and delivery, with our Couriers making up to 3 delivery attempts before diverting your parcel to your nearest ParcelShop.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><!----></div></article><article class="article-link-item article-link-item--neutral" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-6b4a6e25><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6tg4pbqstJ9-e9A_EVRI_LOCATION_05_61717673.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6tg4pbqstJ9-e9A_EVRI_LOCATION_05_6171.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=1644%2C1367%2C5498%2C3667&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6tg4pbqstJ9-e9A_EVRI_LOCATION_05_6171.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=1644%2C1367%2C5498%2C3667&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6tg4pbqstJ9-e9A_EVRI_LOCATION_05_6171.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=1644%2C1367%2C5498%2C3667&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="An Evri Courier walking down the street in a residential area carrying two parcels" width="1000" height="667" class="article-link-item__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__content" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__text-block" data-v-6b4a6e25><!----><!--[--><h3><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->A cheaper parcel service<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h3><!--]--><div class="article-link-item__description" data-v-6b4a6e25><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->We’ll always aim to give you the best prices when you post a parcel with Evri, regardless of whether you choose to use our ParcelShops, Lockers, or Courier Collection service.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><!----></div></article><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section><section id="send-a-parcel-cheaply-with-evri" class="pricing-table" index="4" data-v-ae5ccddd><div class="pricing-table__container" data-v-ae5ccddd><div class="pricing-table__content" data-v-ae5ccddd><div class="reusable-table__wrapper" data-v-ae5ccddd data-v-0e99fcf9><table class="reusable-table__table" data-v-0e99fcf9><thead class="reusable-table__titles" data-v-0e99fcf9><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><th data-v-0e99fcf9>Weight and size</th><th data-v-0e99fcf9>Standard</th><th data-v-0e99fcf9>Upgrade for</th><th data-v-0e99fcf9>Next Day</th><!--]--></tr></thead><tbody class="reusable-table__data" data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><td data-v-0e99fcf9>Postable</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£2.70</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>+£0.79</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£3.49</td><!--]--></tr><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><td data-v-0e99fcf9>0-1kg Small</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£3.04</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>+£0.86</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£3.90</td><!--]--></tr><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><td data-v-0e99fcf9>0-1kg Standard</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£3.29</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>+£0.83</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£4.12</td><!--]--></tr><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><td data-v-0e99fcf9>1-2kg Small</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£3.52</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>+£1.08</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£4.60</td><!--]--></tr><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><td data-v-0e99fcf9>1-2kg Standard</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£4.79</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>+£0.69</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£5.48</td><!--]--></tr><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><td data-v-0e99fcf9>2-5kg</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£6.59</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>+£0.96</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£7.55</td><!--]--></tr><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><td data-v-0e99fcf9>5-10kg</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£6.68</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>+£1.04</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£7.72</td><!--]--></tr><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><td data-v-0e99fcf9>10-15kg</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£10.28</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>+£2.07</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£12.35</td><!--]--></tr><!--]--></tbody></table></div><!----></div><div class="pricing-table__save-section" data-v-ae5ccddd><img src="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/2a1dcc38-ecf2-4a6a-b68d-b28f33e8fe47_send+(1).svg?q=50&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max" srcset="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/2a1dcc38-ecf2-4a6a-b68d-b28f33e8fe47_send+%281%29.svg?q=50&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/2a1dcc38-ecf2-4a6a-b68d-b28f33e8fe47_send+%281%29.svg?q=50&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/2a1dcc38-ecf2-4a6a-b68d-b28f33e8fe47_send+%281%29.svg?q=50&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt width="88" height="24" class="pricing-table__save-section-image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-ae5ccddd><h2 class="pricing-table__save-section-title" data-v-ae5ccddd>Send a parcel cheaply with Evri</h2><div class="pricing-table__save-section-subheader" data-v-ae5ccddd><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Want to send a parcel at a low price? We&#39;re cheaper than you might think! See how much you can <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->save on all parcels up to 15kg<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> using our Standard and Next Day services. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Plus, you can save even more money when you choose a <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/our-services/parcelshop-delivery" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->ParcelShop delivery<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> - it’s your cheapest way to send with us!<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><div class="pricing-table__save-section-buttons-container" data-v-ae5ccddd><!----><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--link pricing-table__save-section-button" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/courier-quote" data-v-ae5ccddd style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[-->Get a quote today<!--]--></span></a></div></div></div></section><section id="our-3-easy-ways-to-send-a-parcel" class="section-wrapper article-link-module article-link-module--neutral conditional-section-wrapper" data-slice-type="article_link_module" data-slice-variation="3Column" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!--[--><h2><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Our 3 easy ways to send a parcel<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h2><!--]--><div class="article-link-module__section-description" data-v-10a41d36><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->We’ve made it easy to post a parcel with Evri by offering you three simple ways to post packages. Learn more about how to use our ParcelShops, Lockers, and Courier Collection service below:<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><div class="article-link-module__cards-container" data-v-10a41d36><!--[--><article class="article-link-item article-link-item--neutral" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-6b4a6e25><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TI_pbqstJ9-Tfc_EVRI_LOCATION_03_258952b8.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TI_pbqstJ9-Tfc_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2589.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=47%2C0%2C5906%2C3939&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TI_pbqstJ9-Tfc_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2589.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=47%2C0%2C5906%2C3939&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TI_pbqstJ9-Tfc_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2589.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=47%2C0%2C5906%2C3939&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="ParcelShop store assistant is smiling and using a blue hand-held device to scan multiple parcels placed on the countertop in front of them. The customer can be seen in the foreground." width="1000" height="667" class="article-link-item__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__content" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__text-block" data-v-6b4a6e25><!----><!--[--><h3><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Our ParcelShops<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h3><!--]--><div class="article-link-item__description" data-v-6b4a6e25><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->We have 9,000+ ParcelShops dotted around the UK for you to use. Simply use our ParcelShop finder tool to locate your closest shop, print your label at home or in-store, for free, and hand your parcel over to the cashier – we’ll take care of the rest!<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><div class="article-link-item__cta" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__buttons" data-v-6b4a6e25><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--link article-link-item__primary" data-gtm-track="a-Parcelshop more information" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/parcelshops" data-v-6b4a6e25 style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[-->ParcelShops<!--]--></span></a><!----></div><!----></div></div></article><article class="article-link-item article-link-item--neutral" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-6b4a6e25><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3033447f.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3033.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C9%2C8164%2C5445&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3033.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C9%2C8164%2C5445&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3033.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C9%2C8164%2C5445&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="Customer holding parcel and standing outside at an Evri Locker, watching as their label prints out" width="1000" height="667" class="article-link-item__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__content" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__text-block" data-v-6b4a6e25><!----><!--[--><h3><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Our Lockers<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h3><!--]--><div class="article-link-item__description" data-v-6b4a6e25><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Like our ParcelShops, our Evri parcel Lockers are a quick, secure, and easy way to drop off your parcels. Open 24/7, you can post a parcel at a time and place convenient to you. Just book a spot online, leave your parcel in one of the available Lockers, and our Couriers will collect it for delivery.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><div class="article-link-item__cta" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__buttons" data-v-6b4a6e25><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--link article-link-item__primary" data-gtm-track="a-Locker more information" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/parcelshops/lockers" data-v-6b4a6e25 style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[-->Lockers<!--]--></span></a><!----></div><!----></div></div></article><article class="article-link-item article-link-item--neutral" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-6b4a6e25><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6pDqpbqstJ9-cfi_EVRI_LOCATION_04_44528a65.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6pDqpbqstJ9-cfi_EVRI_LOCATION_04_4452.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6pDqpbqstJ9-cfi_EVRI_LOCATION_04_4452.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6pDqpbqstJ9-cfi_EVRI_LOCATION_04_4452.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="An Evri Courier scanning multiple parcels for a doorstep collection in a block of flats." width="1000" height="667" class="article-link-item__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__content" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__text-block" data-v-6b4a6e25><!----><!--[--><h3><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Our Courier Collection<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h3><!--]--><div class="article-link-item__description" data-v-6b4a6e25><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Unable to drop your parcel off in person? Not to worry, our Evri Couriers can come straight to you! Whether you’re at home, in the office, or with family, you can book a parcel pick up straight from your door. We’ll even give you a 1 hour window so you can be in to greet your Courier.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><div class="article-link-item__cta" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__buttons" data-v-6b4a6e25><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--link article-link-item__primary" data-gtm-track="a-Courier more information" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/our-services/courier-service" data-v-6b4a6e25 style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[-->Courier Collection<!--]--></span></a><!----></div><!----></div></div></article><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section><section id="section-wrapper" class="section-wrapper wrapper" index="6" data-v-85d73ac7 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><div data-v-85d73ac7><div data-v-85d73ac7 data-v-5d43a0fc><div id="choose-your-parcel-delivery-option" class="list-block__text-container" data-v-5d43a0fc><h2 class="list-block__title" data-v-5d43a0fc>Choose your parcel delivery option</h2><p class="list-block__desc" data-v-5d43a0fc>When sending a parcel with Evri, you can choose from either of our two cheap parcel services – standard delivery or Next Day delivery:</p></div><!--[--><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-s e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05" style="" data-test-id="e-avatar" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-4b59c4a2><img src="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/8321288c-05db-46b8-9767-db5da18fbfae_parcel1.svg" class="e-avatar__image" alt="Icon of a parcel" data-test-id="avatar-image" data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><!----></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><h2 class="link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-9bfd18e9>Standard delivery from £2.62</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Our equivalent of sending a parcel second class with Royal Mail, you can use any of our ParcelShops, Lockers, or Courier Collection services to get your parcel delivered in 2 to 3 days.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div></div></section><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-s e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05" style="" data-test-id="e-avatar" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-4b59c4a2><img src="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/41bf8079-3dd8-48b6-ad6b-013e68421339_above_and_beyond.svg" class="e-avatar__image" alt="Above and beyond icon" data-test-id="avatar-image" data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><!----></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><h2 class="link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-9bfd18e9>Next Day delivery from £3.20</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Drop your parcel off at your nearest ParcelShop or Locker by 12pm on a weekday and we’ll do our best to deliver it for the following working day when you choose our Next Day delivery service.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div></div></section><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></section><section id="send-parcels-abroad" class="landing-feature-banner landing-feature-banner--standard" data-slice-type="landing_feature_banner" data-slice-variation="darkBannerLeftImageButton" data-v-54256dfc><div class="landing-feature-banner__container" data-v-54256dfc><div class="landing-feature-banner__image-container" data-v-54256dfc><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6R1D5bqstJ9-SOx_EVRI_LOCATION_03_24688a65.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6R1D5bqstJ9-SOx_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2468.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6R1D5bqstJ9-SOx_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2468.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6R1D5bqstJ9-SOx_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2468.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="Customer carrying multiple parcels inside a ParcelShop store, ready to drop off for delivery" width="1000" height="667" class="landing-feature-banner__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-54256dfc></div><div class="landing-feature-banner__content--standard landing-feature-banner__content" data-v-54256dfc><!----><!----><h2 class="landing-feature-banner__title" data-v-54256dfc>Send parcels abroad</h2><div class="landing-feature-banner__rich-text landing-feature-banner__rich-text--standard landing-feature-banner__rich-text--padding" data-v-54256dfc><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Did you know you can post a parcel overseas with Evri? We deliver to over 200+ countries and territories for just £6.08! Whether you’re sending gifts to friends and loved ones or items to customers, we can help you post a package fast.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Find out more about sending packages internationally to see how much you could save on sending your parcel abroad.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><div class="landing-feature-banner__button-wrapper" data-v-54256dfc><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-primary e-button--variant-3 e-button--icon-right e-button--link landing-feature-banner__button landing-feature-banner__button--standard" data-gtm-track="a-send international parcels" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/international-send" data-v-54256dfc style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[--> Send international parcel