9,"spans":120,"direction":121},"paragraph","Post a package using any one of our 10,000+ ParcelShops and Lockers across the UK or book a delivery straight from your door with our Courier Collection service, matter where you are in the country.",[],"ltr",{"dimensions":123,"alt":126,"copyright":36,"url":127,"id":128,"edit":129},{"width":124,"height":125},1000,667,"An Evri ParcelShop is in full view with its blue signage and a customer is walking up the accesssbility ramp and holding a parcel.","send.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TJWZbqstJ9-Tf__EVRI_LOCATION_03_3111.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=470%2C0%2C5460%2C3642&w=1000&h=667","Z6TJWZbqstJ9-Tf_",{"x":130,"y":131,"zoom":132,"background":133},470,0,1,"transparent",{"Title":135,"Description":139,"Image":143,"Label":36},[136],{"type":113,"text":137,"spans":138},"A quality delivery service",[],[140],{"type":118,"text":141,"spans":142,"direction":121},"With our standard parcel service, you get full tracking on every delivery, photo confirmation of your parcel’s arrival, and free cover up to a value of £20 as standard. We’ll even provide you with a 1-hour window for both collection and delivery, with our Couriers making up to 3 delivery attempts before diverting your parcel to your nearest ParcelShop.",[],{"dimensions":144,"alt":145,"copyright":36,"url":146,"id":147,"edit":148},{"width":124,"height":125},"A woman is sat at home at her desk smiling looking at her laptop screen","send.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zdBZbqstJ9-inZ_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7819.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6zdBZbqstJ9-inZ",{"x":131,"y":131,"zoom":132,"background":133},{"Title":150,"Description":154,"Image":158,"Label":36},[151],{"type":113,"text":152,"spans":153},"A cheaper parcel service",[],[155],{"type":118,"text":156,"spans":157,"direction":121},"We’ll always aim to give you the best prices when you post a parcel with Evri, regardless of whether you choose to use our ParcelShops, Lockers, or Courier Collection service.",[],{"dimensions":159,"alt":160,"copyright":36,"url":161,"id":162,"edit":163},{"width":124,"height":125},"An Evri Courier walking down the street in a residential area carrying two parcels","send.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6tg4pbqstJ9-e9A_EVRI_LOCATION_05_6171.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=1644%2C1367%2C5498%2C3667&w=1000&h=667","Z6tg4pbqstJ9-e9A",{"x":164,"y":165,"zoom":166,"background":133},1644,1367,1.4899963623135686,{"SectionTitle":168,"SectionDescription":173,"theme":177},[169],{"type":170,"text":171,"spans":172},"heading2","Why send a parcel with Evri?",[],[174],{"type":118,"text":175,"spans":176,"direction":121},"With Evri, you can quickly send a parcel cheaply across the whole of the UK and beyond. UK prices start at £2.62! Even when choosing our standard delivery service, you’ll get immediate access to the following parcel service benefits:",[],"neutral","article_link_module$c2e97e3d-4d71-4b91-a81b-f518d696cce7","article_link_module",{"variation":38,"version":14,"items":181,"primary":222,"id":261,"slice_type":262,"slice_label":36},[182,187,192,197,202,207,212,217],{"column_1_cell":183,"column_2_cell":184,"column_3_cell":185,"column_4_cell":186},"Postable","£2.70","+£0.79","£3.49",{"column_1_cell":188,"column_2_cell":189,"column_3_cell":190,"column_4_cell":191},"0-1kg Small","£3.04","+£0.86","£3.90",{"column_1_cell":193,"column_2_cell":194,"column_3_cell":195,"column_4_cell":196},"0-1kg Standard","£3.29","+£0.83","£4.12",{"column_1_cell":198,"column_2_cell":199,"column_3_cell":200,"column_4_cell":201},"1-2kg Small","£3.52","+£1.08","£4.60",{"column_1_cell":203,"column_2_cell":204,"column_3_cell":205,"column_4_cell":206},"1-2kg Standard","£4.79","+£0.69","£5.48",{"column_1_cell":208,"column_2_cell":209,"column_3_cell":210,"column_4_cell":211},"2-5kg","£6.59","+£0.96","£7.55",{"column_1_cell":213,"column_2_cell":214,"column_3_cell":215,"column_4_cell":216},"5-10kg","£6.68","+£1.04","£7.72",{"column_1_cell":218,"column_2_cell":219,"column_3_cell":220,"column_4_cell":221},"10-15kg","£10.28","+£2.07","£12.35",{"PricingTableImage":223,"PricingTableHeader":231,"PricingTableText":232,"PricingTableButtonText":251,"PricingTableButtonUrl":252,"scrollDown":27,"PricingTablePrimaryButtonText":36,"PricingTablePrimaryButtonUrl":255,"buttonGtmTrack":36,"PricingTableDescription":36,"table_header_row_blue":27,"table_rightmost_column_blue":27,"column_name_1":257,"column_name_2":258,"column_name_3":259,"column_name_4":260},{"dimensions":224,"alt":36,"copyright":36,"url":227,"id":228,"edit":229},{"width":225,"height":226},88,24,"send.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F2a1dcc38-ecf2-4a6a-b68d-b28f33e8fe47_send+%281%29.svg","ZcyF-hIAACgAGOcv",{"x":131,"y":131,"zoom":132,"background":230},"#fff","Send a parcel cheaply with Evri",[233,240],{"type":118,"text":234,"spans":235,"direction":121},"Want to send a parcel at a low price? We're cheaper than you might think! See how much you can save on all parcels up to 15kg using our Standard and Next Day services. ",[236],{"start":237,"end":238,"type":239},95,125,"strong",{"type":118,"text":241,"spans":242,"direction":121},"Plus, you can save even more money when you choose a ParcelShop delivery - it’s your cheapest way to send with us!",[243,250],{"start":244,"end":245,"type":246,"data":247},53,72,"hyperlink",{"link_type":44,"url":248,"target":249},"send.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fparcelshop-delivery","_blank",{"start":244,"end":245,"type":239},"Get a quote today",{"link_type":44,"key":253,"url":254},"0625f66c-2ea9-477c-a40b-9f3fcacba990","send.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fcourier-quote",{"link_type":44,"key":256,"url":254},"c638fd84-f6a9-4f65-bce7-41d7b6d4a213","Weight and size","Standard","Upgrade for","Next Day","pricing_table_v2$f00b2558-748d-4ec6-b409-500216af3b37","pricing_table_v2",{"variation":264,"version":14,"items":265,"primary":332,"id":341,"slice_type":179,"slice_label":36},"3Column",[266,289,311],{"Title":267,"Description":271,"Image":275,"Label":36,"UrlText":282,"Url":283,"buttonDataGtmTrack":286,"SecondaryButtonText":36,"SecondaryButtonUrl":287,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":36,"ShowAppDownloadCta":27},[268],{"type":113,"text":269,"spans":270},"Our ParcelShops",[],[272],{"type":118,"text":273,"spans":274,"direction":121},"We have 9,000+ ParcelShops dotted around the UK for you to use. Simply use our ParcelShop finder tool to locate your closest shop, print your label at home or in-store, for free, and hand your parcel over to the cashier – we’ll take care of the rest!",[],{"dimensions":276,"alt":277,"copyright":36,"url":278,"id":279,"edit":280},{"width":124,"height":125},"ParcelShop store assistant is smiling and using a blue hand-held device to scan multiple parcels placed on the countertop in front of them. The customer can be seen in the foreground.","send.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TI_pbqstJ9-Tfc_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2589.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=47%2C0%2C5906%2C3939&w=1000&h=667","Z6TI_pbqstJ9-Tfc",{"x":281,"y":131,"zoom":132,"background":133},47,"ParcelShops",{"link_type":44,"key":284,"url":285},"195d73b8-342e-4656-9c50-1177b013a7bf","send.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fparcelshops","a-Parcelshop more information",{"link_type":288},"Any",{"Title":290,"Description":294,"Image":298,"Label":36,"UrlText":305,"Url":306,"buttonDataGtmTrack":309,"SecondaryButtonText":36,"SecondaryButtonUrl":310,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":36,"ShowAppDownloadCta":27},[291],{"type":113,"text":292,"spans":293},"Our Lockers",[],[295],{"type":118,"text":296,"spans":297},"Like our ParcelShops, our Evri parcel Lockers are a quick, secure, and easy way to drop off your parcels. Open 24\u002F7, you can post a parcel at a time and place convenient to you. Just book a spot online, leave your parcel in one of the available Lockers, and our Couriers will collect it for delivery.",[],{"dimensions":299,"alt":300,"copyright":36,"url":301,"id":302,"edit":303},{"width":124,"height":125},"Customer holding parcel and standing outside at an Evri Locker, watching as their label prints out","send.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3033.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C9%2C8164%2C5445&w=1000&h=667","Z6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb",{"x":131,"y":304,"zoom":132,"background":133},9,"Lockers",{"link_type":44,"key":307,"url":308},"52d40a16-608b-44d9-8255-38d0ccd16225","send.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fparcelshops\u002Flockers","a-Locker more information",{"link_type":288},{"Title":312,"Description":316,"Image":320,"Label":36,"UrlText":326,"Url":327,"buttonDataGtmTrack":330,"SecondaryButtonText":36,"SecondaryButtonUrl":331,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":36,"ShowAppDownloadCta":27},[313],{"type":113,"text":314,"spans":315},"Our Courier Collection",[],[317],{"type":118,"text":318,"spans":319},"Unable to drop your parcel off in person? Not to worry, our Evri Couriers can come straight to you! Whether you’re at home, in the office, or with family, you can book a parcel pick up straight from your door. We’ll even give you a 1 hour window so you can be in to greet your Courier.",[],{"dimensions":321,"alt":322,"copyright":36,"url":323,"id":324,"edit":325},{"width":124,"height":125},"An Evri Courier scanning multiple parcels for a doorstep collection in a block of flats.","send.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6pDqpbqstJ9-cfi_EVRI_LOCATION_04_4452.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6pDqpbqstJ9-cfi",{"x":131,"y":131,"zoom":132,"background":133},"Courier Collection",{"link_type":44,"key":328,"url":329},"b3288efa-8e08-4d12-9b50-3b6d540ff3dc","send.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fcourier-service","a-Courier more information",{"link_type":288},{"SectionTitle":333,"SectionDescription":337,"theme":177},[334],{"type":170,"text":335,"spans":336},"Our 3 easy ways to send a parcel",[],[338],{"type":118,"text":339,"spans":340},"We’ve made it easy to post a parcel with Evri by offering you three simple ways to post packages. Learn more about how to use our ParcelShops, Lockers, and Courier Collection service below:",[],"article_link_module$6df58bec-9286-4ec8-903c-ce47bc85e0e6",{"variation":343,"version":14,"items":344,"primary":370,"id":374,"slice_type":375,"slice_label":36},"listComponent",[345,358],{"title":346,"content":347,"icon":351},"Standard delivery from £2.62",[348],{"type":118,"text":349,"spans":350,"direction":121},"Our equivalent of sending a parcel second class with Royal Mail, you can use any of our ParcelShops, Lockers, or Courier Collection services to get your parcel delivered in 2 to 3 days.",[],{"dimensions":352,"alt":354,"copyright":36,"url":355,"id":356,"edit":357},{"width":353,"height":353},40,"Icon of a parcel","send.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F8321288c-05db-46b8-9767-db5da18fbfae_parcel1.svg","Yh96FhIAAC4A-Zr2",{"x":131,"y":131,"zoom":132,"background":230},{"title":359,"content":360,"icon":364},"Next Day delivery from £3.20",[361],{"type":118,"text":362,"spans":363,"direction":121},"Drop your parcel off at your nearest ParcelShop or Locker by 12pm on a weekday and we’ll do our best to deliver it for the following working day when you choose our Next Day delivery service.",[],{"dimensions":365,"alt":366,"copyright":36,"url":367,"id":368,"edit":369},{"width":353,"height":353},"Above and beyond icon","send.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F41bf8079-3dd8-48b6-ad6b-013e68421339_above_and_beyond.svg","YflBvREAACIA8pXG",{"x":131,"y":131,"zoom":132,"background":230},{"theme":371,"title":372,"description":373},"standard","Choose your parcel delivery option","When sending a parcel with Evri, you can choose from either of our two cheap parcel services – standard delivery or Next Day delivery:","list_block$6892d28b-30d8-481e-96fc-c967de62b464","list_block",{"variation":377,"version":14,"items":378,"primary":380,"id":401,"slice_type":402,"slice_label":36},"darkBannerLeftImageButton",[379],{},{"theme":371,"show_premium_logo":27,"label":36,"label_theme":381,"titleH2":382,"bodyText":383,"image":390,"buttonText":396,"buttonDataGtmTrack":397,"buttonLink":398,"primary_button_external":27,"button_secondary":400,"secondary_button_external":27},"Core","Send parcels abroad",[384,387],{"type":118,"text":385,"spans":386},"Did you know you can post a parcel overseas with Evri? We deliver to over 200+ countries and territories for just £6.08! Whether you’re sending gifts to friends and loved ones or items to customers, we can help you post a package fast.",[],{"type":118,"text":388,"spans":389},"Find out more about sending packages internationally to see how much you could save on sending your parcel abroad.",[],{"dimensions":391,"alt":392,"copyright":36,"url":393,"id":394,"edit":395},{"width":124,"height":125},"Customer carrying multiple parcels inside a ParcelShop store, ready to drop off for delivery","send.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6R1D5bqstJ9-SOx_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2468.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6R1D5bqstJ9-SOx",{"x":131,"y":131,"zoom":132,"background":133},"Send international parcels","a-send international parcels",{"link_type":44,"key":399,"url":46},"1124da19-18af-4233-942b-168de28162e4",{"link_type":288},"landing_feature_banner$52b94c11-1295-4511-b17e-dd80a1c1695b","landing_feature_banner",{"variation":38,"version":14,"items":404,"primary":406,"id":415,"slice_type":416,"slice_label":36},[405],{},{"heading":407,"description":408,"image":409},"We're trusted by our customers and retailers","We provide parcel delivery services for many of the UK's top retail brands, including Next, ASOS, BooHoo, Missguided, PrettyLittleThing, John Lewis, Debenhams, eBay, Amazon, and many more.\n\nCheck out our reviews to see what our customers have to say:",{"dimensions":410,"alt":411,"copyright":36,"url":412,"id":413,"edit":414},{"width":124,"height":125},"An Evri courier is handing three parcels to a man at his doorstep. They are both laughing as if a funny joke or anecdote was shared.","send.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zdJ5bqstJ9-iny_EVRI_LOCATION_05_8248.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6zdJ5bqstJ9-iny",{"x":131,"y":131,"zoom":132,"background":133},"trust_pilot$30895521-3fa7-4311-a1a6-6d710665612f","trust_pilot",{"variation":38,"version":14,"items":418,"primary":433,"id":436,"slice_type":71,"slice_label":36},[419,426],{"title":420,"content":421,"pillEnabled":27,"link":422,"dataGtmTrack":425},"How to send a parcel","There are 3 easy steps to send a parcel",{"link_type":44,"key":423,"url":424},"c626df36-8dbb-4e4c-bf6c-1bd6145a1f2f","send.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fsend\u002Fhow-to-send-a-parcel","a-how to send a parcel",{"title":427,"content":428,"pillEnabled":27,"link":429,"dataGtmTrack":432},"How to measure your parcel","Measure your parcel with our simple size and weight limits",{"link_type":44,"key":430,"url":431},"5d073027-ff03-4033-bd2b-61b67cb93ce7","send.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fsend\u002Fparcel-size-and-weight-guide","a-how to measure your parcel",{"sectionTitle":434,"sectionDescription":435,"pillEnabled":27,"showPaddingTop":27},"How to guides","Need help sending packages? We've created several step-by-step guides to help make sending your parcel as simple and easy as possible:","feature_link_cards$9714b77e-d239-468c-a6e7-7a100e3113e6",{"variation":38,"version":14,"items":438,"primary":453,"id":454,"slice_type":71,"slice_label":36},[439,446],{"title":440,"content":441,"pillEnabled":27,"link":442,"dataGtmTrack":445},"How to send a parcel abroad","Send parcels overseas to customers, friends and family",{"link_type":44,"key":443,"url":444},"cd1c3e52-9f7b-48a7-b112-9f37bcc1a8ba","send.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services","a-how to send a parcel abroad",{"title":447,"content":448,"pillEnabled":27,"link":449,"dataGtmTrack":452},"How to wrap a parcel","Read our step-by-step guide on how to package a parcel properly",{"link_type":44,"key":450,"url":451},"3472b31a-3631-42de-b208-5388daf973f0","send.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fsend\u002Fhow-to-wrap-a-parcel","a-how to wrap a parcel",{"sectionTitle":36,"sectionDescription":36,"pillEnabled":27,"showPaddingTop":27},"feature_link_cards$27349e07-57a1-4ff6-994c-899eeff118ae",{"variation":38,"version":14,"items":456,"primary":471,"id":472,"slice_type":71,"slice_label":36},[457,464],{"title":458,"content":459,"pillEnabled":27,"link":460,"dataGtmTrack":463},"How to print labels in our ParcelShops","Follow the info in this guide to learn about using our Print in ParcelShop devices",{"link_type":44,"key":461,"url":462},"09ba20a0-7e3a-4ff5-94d9-6cd2a1110c2e","send.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fparcelshops\u002Fprint-in-parcelshop","a-how do i print labels at a parcelshop",{"title":465,"content":466,"pillEnabled":27,"link":467,"dataGtmTrack":470},"How to track your parcel","Discover how to track your parcel’s journey every step of the way",{"link_type":44,"key":468,"url":469},"b21d6ad3-81e9-4a87-824e-4480b122c42e","send.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Ftrack-a-parcel","a-how do i track my parcel",{"sectionTitle":36,"sectionDescription":36,"pillEnabled":27,"showPaddingTop":27},"feature_link_cards$af32f23e-fae5-4ad8-8581-dd7a22b75740",{"variation":38,"version":14,"items":474,"primary":521,"id":523,"slice_type":524,"slice_label":36},[475,501,510],{"questionTitle":476,"questionBody":477},"Can I buy cover for my parcel?",[478,481,484,493],{"type":118,"text":479,"spans":480,"direction":121},"We include parcel cover up to a value of £20, for free, on most items sent with us – excluding prohibited items and postable parcels. However, if your parcel’s value is worth more than £20, then you can increase the value of your item’s cover up to a maximum of £999.",[],{"type":118,"text":482,"spans":483,"direction":121},"It’s important to note, however, that some items you can send with us can’t be covered. These are called non-compensation items and include items such as glassware, furniture, musical instruments, TVs, legal documents, and items valued over £999.",[],{"type":118,"text":485,"spans":486,"direction":121},"Please take a look at our non-compensation items list for a breakdown of what items we can and can’t cover. We’re still happy to carry non-compensation items for delivery but know that when you send any of these items with us, you do so at your own risk.",[487,491],{"start":488,"end":244,"type":246,"data":489},26,{"link_type":44,"url":490,"target":249},"send.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fsend\u002Fwhat-i-can-and-cannot-send",{"start":488,"end":492,"type":239},54,{"type":118,"text":494,"spans":495,"direction":121},"Naturally, on top of those items that fall under our non-compensation category, any item that is flagged as a prohibited item is not covered by our parcel service, no matter its value.",[496,499],{"start":497,"end":238,"type":246,"data":498},110,{"link_type":44,"url":490,"target":249},{"start":497,"end":500,"type":239},126,{"questionTitle":502,"questionBody":503},"Can I change the delivery address after I’ve sent a parcel?",[504,507],{"type":118,"text":505,"spans":506},"Yes. If it’s a simple house name\u002Fnumber change, the easiest thing to do is ask the parcel recipient to divert the parcel to the correct house name\u002Fnumber. ",[],{"type":118,"text":508,"spans":509},"If, on the other hand, your recipient needs a full address change, then contact our customer service team with the change you need once the parcel is with its Courier. We’ll then do our best to get the parcel stopped and the address corrected before the delivery is made to the original address.",[],{"questionTitle":511,"questionBody":512},"How will I know when my parcel has been delivered?",[513],{"type":118,"text":514,"spans":515,"direction":121},"You can track your parcel through its entire journey, right up until the point of delivery with our parcel tracking service. This means you can see where your parcel is at each stage of the delivery process. We explain each stage of the process on our tracking page to make this easy to follow.",[516,520],{"start":517,"end":518,"type":246,"data":519},96,123,{"link_type":44,"url":469,"target":249},{"start":517,"end":518,"type":239},{"title":522},"Send a parcel FAQs","frequently_asked_questions$011919be-7439-4264-bf46-eb10a5999340","frequently_asked_questions",[12,37,526,107,180,263,342,376,403,417,437,455,473],{"variation":73,"version":14,"items":74,"primary":102,"id":105,"slice_type":106,"slice_label":36,"nestedSlices":527},[528,554,576],{"id":77,"uid":36,"url":36,"type":78,"href":529,"tags":530,"first_publication_date":82,"last_publication_date":83,"slugs":531,"linked_documents":532,"lang":21,"alternate_languages":533,"data":534},"send.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22ak9Q3RIAACwAeVs8%22%29+%5D%5D",[80],[81],[],[],{"gaCampaignName":81,"title":535,"background":536,"description":537,"label":538,"buttonText":539,"buttonAriaLabel":539,"buttonLink":540,"showAppStoreLinks":27,"icon":36,"image":542,"vimeoLink":552,"videoTitle":36,"slices":553},"Send small for less","neutral-01","Introducing our new 0-2kg small parcel size, up to 17% cheaper than Royal Mail Click & Drop.","NEW","Discover small parcels",{"link_type":44,"key":541,"url":67},"daa3fb79-4514-465f-8f3d-a13c046e1376",{"link_type":543,"key":544,"kind":545,"id":546,"url":547,"name":548,"size":549,"width":550,"height":551},"Media","c26de61f-4bfd-4333-9947-77e3f7f5c8f4","image","Z7b8Np7c43Q3f_9C","send.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ7b8Np7c43Q3f_9C_EVRI_LOCATION_01_0835-3-1-.jpg?auto=format,compress?auto=compress,format","404-not-found.html","345802","1000","666",{"link_type":288},[],{"id":87,"uid":36,"url":36,"type":78,"href":555